{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a nightmarish version of rural Georgia armed with only a flashlight, your wits, and the right to bear arms. Scavenge, conserve, solve puzzles, and fight your way through relentless enemies who know the shadows better than you ever will. Every shadow conceals a new terror.<br><br>Nightwalk Simulator DOES NOT hold your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/TL_NWSIM_AlienInDistance.gif?t=1744250172\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re trapped in a warped version of rural Georgia, where the night never ends and the dead don\u2019t stay down. <strong>Zombies don\u2019t stumble\u2014they sprint. Full speed. No hesitation.</strong> They won\u2019t stop until you stop them, and if you miss your shot, you won\u2019t get a second chance. <strong>Aliens stalk the glow of streetlights, getting stronger the closer they get.</strong> The deeper you go, the more they spread. And the <strong>ships?</strong> They hunt from above, scanning the roads for anything still breathing. If your flashlight is on, <strong>they will see you.</strong> If they see you, <strong>you run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/NWSIM_AlienAbduction_01.gif?t=1744250172\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every bullet matters. Every battery is a lifeline. You can\u2019t waste either. You\u2019ll need to <strong>scavenge, outmaneuver, and think fast</strong> if you want to survive. There\u2019s nowhere to hide\u2014the forest swallows the moonlight, the roads stretch into nothing, and the screams in the distance mean <strong>something else is out there.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019re lucky, you\u2019ll stumble across a <strong>ringing payphone.</strong> Walk up, interact, and you might just get your hands on something <strong>random</strong>\u2014an <strong>SMG, a better pistol, or something even deadlier</strong> to help you fight back instead of running for your life.<br><br> A true quintuple-A experience \ud83d\ude08 </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018030?t=1744250172","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3018030?t=1744250172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744250172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744250172","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work: Frequent Violence or Gore, General Mature Content"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate a nightmarish version of rural Georgia armed with only a flashlight, your wits, and the right to bear arms. Scavenge, conserve, solve puzzles, and fight your way through relentless enemies who know the shadows better than you ever will. Every shadow conceals a new terror.<br><br>Nightwalk Simulator DOES NOT hold your hand!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/TL_NWSIM_AlienInDistance.gif?t=1744250172\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re trapped in a warped version of rural Georgia, where the night never ends and the dead don\u2019t stay down. <strong>Zombies don\u2019t stumble\u2014they sprint. Full speed. No hesitation.</strong> They won\u2019t stop until you stop them, and if you miss your shot, you won\u2019t get a second chance. <strong>Aliens stalk the glow of streetlights, getting stronger the closer they get.</strong> The deeper you go, the more they spread. And the <strong>ships?</strong> They hunt from above, scanning the roads for anything still breathing. If your flashlight is on, <strong>they will see you.</strong> If they see you, <strong>you run.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/extras/NWSIM_AlienAbduction_01.gif?t=1744250172\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every bullet matters. Every battery is a lifeline. You can\u2019t waste either. You\u2019ll need to <strong>scavenge, outmaneuver, and think fast</strong> if you want to survive. There\u2019s nowhere to hide\u2014the forest swallows the moonlight, the roads stretch into nothing, and the screams in the distance mean <strong>something else is out there.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019re lucky, you\u2019ll stumble across a <strong>ringing payphone.</strong> Walk up, interact, and you might just get your hands on something <strong>random</strong>\u2014an <strong>SMG, a better pistol, or something even deadlier</strong> to help you fight back instead of running for your life.<br><br> A true quintuple-A experience \ud83d\ude08 </p>","developers":["Darlington Group LLC"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3018030/header.jpg?t=1744250172","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257122901,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store